Problem Understanding
What the problem is asking: Now the program is to be expanded by adding tournaments,AI for each of the three difficulties(easy, medium, hard),and status effects.

Key concepts involved: Since the implementation of the tournament mode requires an array of modifiable length, vectors are used instead of fixed-length arrays.

My approach: Very straightforward. 
AI : four modes(0-manual,1-easy(random),2-medium(strongest),3-hard(heal,inflict status or damage as and when applicable)).
Status effects: deal with mostly in the attack function of the bender.
Tournament: vector of participants gets updated each round until there is only one member.

